  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Moon Over Goldsboro** (1 other source): At the start, two men stood to the taper's right and chatted, ignoring warnings that a recording was underway [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Wizard Buys a Hat**: rare: 4 archived performances [2]\n- **The Mess Inside**: back after 33 archived shows (1074 days) [2]\n- **November Love Song**: rare: 3 archived performances [2]\n- **Going to Kansas**: rare: 12 archived performances [2]\n- **Mosquito Repellent**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 6 archived performances [2]\n- **Supergenesis**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 6 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mountaingoats2008-10-13.flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 16 songs; 74 min [1]. Said about its sound: A loose cable killed the left channel for the first 1:10 of track one; the uploader patched it by copying the right channel across [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mountaingoats2008-10-13.flac16**: taped by ezralite23; transferred by ezralite23; source: Sony ECM-DS70P > SPSB-11 Batt Box > Sony MZ-M200 [1]",
